    "text": "IN accordance with the provisions of section 28 of the Wages Boards Ordinance (Chapter 136), the Wages Board for the Textile Manufacturing Trade hereby notifies that the Board, by virtue of the powers vested in it by Section 30 of the aforesaid ordinance, proposes to vary in the manner set out in the Schedule hereto, such decisions of the Board as are specified in that Schedule.",
